  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the administrative capability of Mozambique&#x2019;s Revenue Authority  - Tax Common Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen tax administration in Mozambique by providing support to Mozambique&#x2019;s Revenue Authority. A more effective, efficient and fair tax system will contribute to enhance Mozambique&#x2019;s domestic revenue mobilisation and gradually reduce aid dependency over the duration of the programme (2013-2019). This will indirectly benefit the wider population of Mozambique.</narrative>
  </description>
